            "detailed_description": "Boratium Wars is a fast paced arcade style space shooter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission: Collect Boratium resources from moving asteroids while avoiding dangerous obstacles, enemy competitors, and environmental hazards.<br />\r\nWhat drives you: Wealth, Power, and a desire to be viewed as the very best!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse earnings from successful missions to upgrade your ships, or acquire new ships with an array of customizing to master both the art of survival and Boratium mining.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSuccessful progression through the outer debris ring of the galaxy, increases both your rewards and difficulty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvanced weaponry and tooling technologies allow the practiced to survive ruthless onslaughts of asteroids as well as both deadly human and aliens threats.<br />\r\nFeel the pressure as countless waves of high speed volatile threats, as you develop your strategy to not only survive, but flourish in the cold dark of space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay with keyboard and mouse, or use a Steam or Xbox compatible controllers.<br />\r\nFully supports controller play, for those who prefer a controller.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScore Steam achievements and Boratium Tokens used to increase your fleet of ships.<br />\r\nGet ranked on the global leader boards in both Galactic Top Pilot overall, and individual Top Pilot ranks by each ship class.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTons of fun for all ages!",
            "about_the_game": "Boratium Wars is a fast paced arcade style space shooter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission: Collect Boratium resources from moving asteroids while avoiding dangerous obstacles, enemy competitors, and environmental hazards.<br />\r\nWhat drives you: Wealth, Power, and a desire to be viewed as the very best!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse earnings from successful missions to upgrade your ships, or acquire new ships with an array of customizing to master both the art of survival and Boratium mining.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSuccessful progression through the outer debris ring of the galaxy, increases both your rewards and difficulty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvanced weaponry and tooling technologies allow the practiced to survive ruthless onslaughts of asteroids as well as both deadly human and aliens threats.<br />\r\nFeel the pressure as countless waves of high speed volatile threats, as you develop your strategy to not only survive, but flourish in the cold dark of space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay with keyboard and mouse, or use a Steam or Xbox compatible controllers.<br />\r\nFully supports controller play, for those who prefer a controller.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScore Steam achievements and Boratium Tokens used to increase your fleet of ships.<br />\r\nGet ranked on the global leader boards in both Galactic Top Pilot overall, and individual Top Pilot ranks by each ship class.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTons of fun for all ages!",
            "short_description": "Boratium Wars is a fast paced arcade style space shooter. Your skills are put to the test, as you attempt to collect Boratium from deep space, while avoiding enemies, mines, and more. Supports keyboard and mouse, as well as controller play. Tons of fun!",
