                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is awesome! The attention to detail with the spaceships, in-game dashboard, unique in-motion backgrounds went above and beyond my expectations. Not to mention that both my kids (ages 3 & 6) and I are loving the sound tracks while mining for income and evading/destroying enemies that cross our path. While the overall objective in the game remains the same through each level, earning new weapons and defenses as well as new ships and running into harder combat situations keeps me coming back for more. Sci-Fi fans rejoice, this game is totally worth your time and a good way to get a healthy competition started between friends to see who can rule the score boards. Also, it's a great way to introduce your kids to the sci-fi gaming genre and help enhance their hand eye coordination.",
